Text: Graphical summarizers like TextRank have also provided great benchmark results.TextRank assigns weights to important keywords from the document using graph-based model and sentences which capture most of those concepts/keywords are ranked higher) (Barrera and Verma, 2012, Mihalcea and Tarau, 2004) TextRank Google’s PageRank (Brin and Page, 1998) for graphical modeling. Though semantic and graphical models may better capture the sense of document but miss out on statistical view.

